Package: laptop-keyboard-auto-toggle
Version: 1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyudev, python3-gi, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: tanim913 <42853370+tanim913@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/tanim913/LaptopKeyboardAutoToggle
Description: Automatically disables laptop internal keyboard when wireless USB dongle is connected.
 A lightweight background daemon and system tray indicator for Ubuntu and Debian
 that detects your wireless keyboard's USB dongle and silences the faulty internal
 laptop keyboard at the Linux kernel level (serio bus unbind). Also provides a top bar
 tray icon to manually toggle the internal keyboard ON or OFF anytime.
